            "value" : "常規"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Common %@–%@ %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常用 %1$@–%2$@ %3$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常用 %1$@–%2$@ %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Competitive μ-Opioid Receptor Antagonist (Short-Acting)" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "竞争性 μ-阿片受体拮抗剂(短效)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "競爭性 μ-阿片受體拮抗劑(短效)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Competitively antagonizes adenosine A1 and A2A receptors. Adenosine normally promotes sleep and suppresses arousal; blocking its receptors increases wakefulness and alertness. A2A antagonism in the striatum indirectly enhances dopaminergic signaling. At supratherapeutic doses, also inhibits phosphodiesterases (increasing intracellular cAMP), but this effect is less significant at normal dietary doses." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "竞争性拮抗腺苷 A1 和 A2A 受体。腺苷通常促进睡眠并抑制觉醒;阻断其受体会增加清醒度和警觉度。纹状体中的 A2A 拮抗作用间接增强多巴胺能信号。在超治疗剂量下,也抑制磷酸二酯酶(增加细胞内 cAMP),但在正常膳食剂量下此效应不显著。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "競爭性拮抗腺苷 A1 和 A2A 受體。腺苷通常促進睡眠並抑制覺醒;阻斷其受體會增加清醒度和警覺度。紋狀體中的 A2A 拮抗作用間接增強多巴胺能訊號。在超治療劑量下,也抑制磷酸二酯酶(增加細胞內 cAMP),但在正常膳食劑量下此效應不顯著。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Competitively blocks β-adrenergic receptors, preventing the effects of catecholamines. β1-selective agents primarily reduce heart rate and cardiac contractility. Non-selective agents also block β2 receptors in bronchial smooth muscle and peripheral vasculature. Used for hypertension, arrhythmias, heart failure, and performance anxiety." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "竞争性阻断 β-肾上腺素受体,阻止儿茶酚胺的效应。β1-选择性药物主要降低心率和心肌收缩力。非选择性药物也阻断支气管平滑肌和外周血管中的 β2 受体。用于高血压、心律失常、心力衰竭和表演焦虑。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "競爭性阻斷 β-腎上腺素受體,阻止兒茶酚胺的效應。β1-選擇性藥物主要降低心率和心肌收縮力。非選擇性藥物也阻斷支氣管平滑肌和外周血管中的 β2 受體。用於高血壓、心律不整、心衰竭和表演焦慮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Competitively inhibits 3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-coenzyme A (HMG-CoA) reductase, the rate-limiting enzyme in hepatic cholesterol synthesis. Reduced intracellular cholesterol upregulates LDL receptor expression on hepatocytes, increasing LDL clearance from the blood. Also produces pleiotropic effects including improved endothelial function and anti-inflammatory activity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "竞争性抑制 3-羟基-3-甲基戊二酰辅酶 A (HMG-CoA) 还原酶,这是肝胆固醇合成的限速酶。细胞内胆固醇降低上调肝细胞上的 LDL 受体表达,增加血液中 LDL 的清除。也产生多效作用,包括改善内皮功能和抗炎活性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "競爭性抑制 3-羥基-3-甲基戊二醯輔酶 A (HMG-CoA) 還原酶,這是肝膽固醇合成的限速酶。細胞內膽固醇降低上調肝細胞上的 LDL 受體表達,增加血液中 LDL 的清除。也產生多效作用,包括改善內皮功能和抗炎活性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded CNS depression — excessive sedation and impaired breathing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加的中枢抑制 — 过度镇静和呼吸受损。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加的中樞抑制 — 過度鎮靜和呼吸受損。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded dissociation — disorientation and loss of motor control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加的解离 — 定向障碍和运动控制丧失。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "疊加的解離 — 定向障礙和運動控制喪失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compounded drowsiness and impaired coordination." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叠加的嗜睡和协调受损。"
