    "Consider waiting ~%@ more" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建议再等待约 %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建議再等待約 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contains multiple active constituents including hypericin and hyperforin. Hyperforin inhibits the reuptake of serotonin, norepinephrine, dopamine, GABA, and glutamate by activating TRPC6 ion channels, which increase intracellular sodium and reduce transporter function. Also weakly inhibits MAO-A. Potent inducer of CYP3A4, causing clinically significant drug interactions with many medications." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "含多种活性成分,包括金丝桃素和贯叶金丝桃素。贯叶金丝桃素通过激活 TRPC6 离子通道(增加细胞内钠并降低转运体功能)抑制血清素、去甲肾上腺素、多巴胺、GABA 和谷氨酸的再摄取。也弱抑制 MAO-A。强效 CYP3A4 诱导剂,与许多药物产生临床显著的相互作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "含多種活性成分,包括金絲桃素和貫葉金絲桃素。貫葉金絲桃素透過激活 TRPC6 離子通道(增加細胞內鈉並降低轉運體功能)抑制血清素、去甲腎上腺素、多巴胺、GABA 和麩胺酸的再攝取。也弱抑制 MAO-A。強效 CYP3A4 誘導劑,與許多藥物產生臨床顯著的相互作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contraindications & Cautions" : {
      "localizations" : {
