            "value" : "解离剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解離劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distinguished by high 5-HT2A affinity relative to D2, with uniquely rapid D2 dissociation ('fast-off' theory). Has significant affinity for D1, D3, D4, muscarinic M1/M4, histamine H1, and α1/α2-adrenergic receptors. This broad receptor profile underlies its unique efficacy in treatment-resistant schizophrenia. M1/M4 muscarinic activity may contribute to cognitive benefits. Risk of agranulocytosis necessitates blood monitoring." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其特征是相对于 D2 具有高 5-HT2A 亲和力,以及独特的快速 D2 解离(「快速脱离」理论)。对 D1、D3、D4、毒蕈碱 M1/M4、组胺 H1 和 α1/α2-肾上腺素受体有显著亲和力。这种广泛的受体谱是其在难治性精神分裂症中独特疗效的基础。M1/M4 毒蕈碱活性可能对认知益处有贡献。粒细胞缺乏症的风险需要血液监测。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其特徵是相對於 D2 具有高 5-HT2A 親和力,以及獨特的快速 D2 解離(「快速脫離」理論)。對 D1、D3、D4、蕈毒鹼 M1/M4、組胺 H1 和 α1/α2-腎上腺素受體有顯著親和力。這種廣泛的受體譜是其在難治性精神分裂症中獨特療效的基礎。M1/M4 蕈毒鹼活性可能對認知益處有貢獻。顆粒性白血球缺乏症的風險需要血液監測。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Does not directly activate CB1 or CB2 receptors at physiological concentrations. Acts as a negative allosteric modulator of CB1, reducing the efficacy of agonists like THC. Activates 5-HT1A receptors (anxiolytic), TRPV1 vanilloid receptors (analgesic), and PPARγ nuclear receptors (anti-inflammatory). Inhibits fatty acid amide hydrolase (FAAH), increasing endogenous anandamide levels." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在生理浓度下不直接激活 CB1 或 CB2 受体。作为 CB1 的负向变构调节剂,降低 THC 等激动剂的效能。激活 5-HT1A 受体(抗焦虑)、TRPV1 香草素受体(镇痛)和 PPARγ 核受体(抗炎)。抑制脂肪酸酰胺水解酶 (FAAH),提高内源性花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在生理濃度下不直接激活 CB1 或 CB2 受體。作為 CB1 的負向變構調節劑,降低 THC 等激動劑的效能。激活 5-HT1A 受體(抗焦慮)、TRPV1 香草素受體(鎮痛)和 PPARγ 核受體(抗炎)。抑制脂肪酸醯胺水解酶 (FAAH),提高內源性花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Does not directly activate CB1 or CB2 receptors at physiological concentrations. Acts as a negative allosteric modulator of CB1, reducing the efficacy of agonists like THC. Activates 5-HT1A receptors (anxiolytic), TRPV1 vanilloid receptors (analgesic), and PPARγ nuclear receptors (anti-inflammatory). Inhibits fatty acid amide hydrolase (FAAH), increasing endogenous anandamide levels. Also antagonizes GPR55." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在生理浓度下不直接激活 CB1 或 CB2 受体。作为 CB1 的负向变构调节剂,降低 THC 等激动剂的效能。激活 5-HT1A 受体(抗焦虑)、TRPV1 香草素受体(镇痛)和 PPARγ 核受体(抗炎)。抑制脂肪酸酰胺水解酶 (FAAH),提高内源性花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平。也拮抗 GPR55。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在生理濃度下不直接激活 CB1 或 CB2 受體。作為 CB1 的負向變構調節劑,降低 THC 等激動劑的效能。激活 5-HT1A 受體(抗焦慮)、TRPV1 香草素受體(鎮痛)和 PPARγ 核受體(抗炎)。抑制脂肪酸醯胺水解酶 (FAAH),提高內源性花生四烯酸乙醇胺水平。也拮抗 GPR55。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
