    },
    "Dosing for this medication is determined by a healthcare provider and is not shown here. The information below is for recognition and reference only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该药物的用量由医疗专业人员决定，此处不予显示。以下信息仅供识别与参考。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該藥物的用量由醫療專業人員決定，此處不予顯示。以下資訊僅供辨識與參考。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dosing shown reflects clinical or community research protocols, not medical advice. Peptides are injected from reconstituted powder — handle and store as noted below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所示剂量反映临床或社区研究方案，并非医疗建议。肽类需由冻干粉复溶后注射——请按下方说明处理和储存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所示劑量反映臨床或社群研究方案，並非醫療建議。胜肽需由凍乾粉復溶後注射——請按下方說明處理與儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
