    "Drink some water. Stimulants mask thirst — your body needs more fluids than you realize." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝点水。兴奋剂会掩盖口渴感 — 您的身体需要的水分比您意识到的更多。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝點水。興奮劑會掩蓋口渴感 — 您的身體需要的水分比您意識到的更多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink some water. Your body needs it, especially right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝点水。您的身体需要水分,尤其是现在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝點水。您的身體需要水分,尤其是現在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water — cotton mouth means you've been dehydrating." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水 — 口干意味着您在脱水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水 — 口乾意味著您在脫水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water — depressants are dehydrating, especially alcohol." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水 — 抑制剂会导致脱水,特别是酒精。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水 — 抑制劑會導致脫水,特別是酒精。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water and eat something — stable blood sugar helps mood." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水并吃点东西 — 稳定的血糖有助于情绪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水並吃點東西 — 穩定的血糖有助於情緒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water and eat something nutritious." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水并吃些营养食物。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水並吃些營養食物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water and eat something with electrolytes. Rest in a cool, dark room if your head hurts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水并吃含电解质的东西。如果头痛,请在凉爽、昏暗的房间里休息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水並吃含電解質的東西。如果頭痛,請在涼爽、昏暗的房間裡休息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water or an electrolyte drink. You've been dehydrating without noticing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水或电解质饮料。您一直在脱水却没有察觉。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水或電解質飲料。您一直在脫水卻沒有察覺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water, eat something balanced. If foggy, a short walk or fresh air helps clear it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水、吃均衡的食物。如感到迷糊,短暂散步或呼吸新鲜空气有助清醒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水、吃均衡的食物。如感到迷糊,短暫散步或呼吸新鮮空氣有助清醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water. Eat something simple when your stomach allows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水。胃部允许时吃些简单的食物。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喝水。胃部允許時吃些簡單的食物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drink water. Wrap up in something comfortable." : {
      "localizations" : {
