    },
    "Each link opens this substance's page on that source. Always verify against the original." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个链接都会打开该来源中此物质的页面。请始终对照原始来源核实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個連結都會開啟該來源中此物質的頁面。請始終對照原始來源核實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat a nutritious meal, drink water, and rest. Magnesium and vitamin C may help. Don't fight the tiredness — your body needs recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃一顿营养餐、喝水并休息。镁和维生素 C 可能有帮助。不要对抗疲劳 — 您的身体需要恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃一頓營養餐、喝水並休息。鎂和維生素 C 可能有幫助。不要對抗疲勞 — 您的身體需要恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat light foods: fruit, toast, soup. Your stomach may be sensitive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃清淡食物:水果、吐司、汤。您的胃可能比较敏感。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃清淡食物:水果、吐司、湯。您的胃可能比較敏感。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something — even if you're not hungry. Protein and complex carbs help most." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点东西 — 即使您不饿。蛋白质和复合碳水化合物最有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點東西 — 即使您不餓。蛋白質和複合碳水化合物最有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something balanced. The munchies may have had you eating junk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些均衡的食物。嘴馋可能让您吃了垃圾食品。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些均衡的食物。嘴饞可能讓您吃了垃圾食品。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something grounding — warm food, fruit, or anything that sounds appealing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些让人安定的东西 — 温热的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些讓人安定的東西 — 溫熱的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something light. Your appetite may be suppressed but food helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
