    "Every backup is sealed with AES-256-GCM — the same authenticated encryption used by modern secure messengers. Tampering is detected and refused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个备份都使用 AES-256-GCM 封装——与现代安全通讯软件采用的认证加密相同。任何篡改都会被检测并拒绝。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個備份都使用 AES-256-GCM 封裝——與現代安全通訊軟體採用的認證加密相同。任何竄改都會被偵測並拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
