          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部內容 — 受體結合表、偏向性激動、CYP 代謝，以及精確到 DOI 的文獻引用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Piru stores locally. Your dose data lives only on this device unless you turn on iCloud backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 在本机存储的全部内容。除非开启 iCloud 备份，你的剂量数据只保存在这台设备上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 在本機儲存的全部內容。除非開啟 iCloud 備份，你的劑量資料只保存在這部裝置上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything that doesn't fit a class above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不属于以上任何类别的物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不屬於以上任何類別的物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact mechanism incompletely understood. Inhibits inositol monophosphatase (IMPase), depleting inositol and modulating phosphoinositide signaling. Inhibits glycogen synthase kinase-3β (GSK-3β), regulating neuroplasticity, circadian rhythm, and neuroprotection. Modulates glutamate neurotransmission by reducing NMDA receptor activity. Also affects protein kinase C, cAMP, and arachidonic acid metabolism." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确切机制尚未完全了解。抑制肌醇单磷酸酶 (IMPase),消耗肌醇并调节磷酸肌醇信号传导。抑制糖原合成激酶-3β (GSK-3β),调节神经可塑性、昼夜节律和神经保护。通过降低 NMDA 受体活性调节谷氨酸神经传递。也影响蛋白激酶 C、cAMP 和花生四烯酸代谢。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確切機制尚未完全了解。抑制肌醇單磷酸酶 (IMPase),消耗肌醇並調節磷酸肌醇訊號傳導。抑制糖原合成激酶-3β (GSK-3β),調節神經可塑性、晝夜節律和神經保護。透過降低 NMDA 受體活性調節麩胺酸神經傳導。也影響蛋白激酶 C、cAMP 和花生四烯酸代謝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact mechanism not fully established. Activates AMP-activated protein kinase (AMPK), which inhibits hepatic gluconeogenesis and increases insulin sensitivity in peripheral tissues. Also inhibits mitochondrial complex I, altering the cellular energy state. Does not stimulate insulin secretion and does not cause hypoglycemia when used alone. May also modulate the gut microbiome and increase GLP-1 levels." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确切机制尚未完全确立。激活 AMP 活化蛋白激酶 (AMPK),抑制肝糖异生并增加外周组织的胰岛素敏感性。也抑制线粒体复合物 I,改变细胞能量状态。不刺激胰岛素分泌,单独使用时不引起低血糖。也可能调节肠道微生物组并提高 GLP-1 水平。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確切機制尚未完全確立。激活 AMP 活化蛋白激酶 (AMPK),抑制肝糖異生並增加外周組織的胰島素敏感性。也抑制粒線體複合體 I,改變細胞能量狀態。不刺激胰島素分泌,單獨使用時不引起低血糖。也可能調節腸道微生物組並提高 GLP-1 水平。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exact mechanism not fully established. Modulates AMPA-type glutamate receptors (positive allosteric modulation), enhancing glutamatergic neurotransmission and synaptic plasticity. May also increase acetylcholine turnover and improve cerebral blood flow. Individual racetams vary in their receptor selectivity and additional mechanisms." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确切机制尚未完全确立。调节 AMPA 型谷氨酸受体(正向变构调节),增强谷氨酸能神经传递和突触可塑性。也可能增加乙酰胆碱周转并改善脑血流。各吡拉西坦类药物在受体选择性和其他机制上有所不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "確切機制尚未完全確立。調節 AMPA 型麩胺酸受體(正向變構調節),增強麩胺酸能神經傳導和突觸可塑性。也可能增加乙醯膽鹼周轉並改善腦血流。各吡拉西坦類藥物在受體選擇性和其他機制上有所不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excessive sedation and respiratory depression risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
