    "If nauseous, small sips of water and lying on your side help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到恶心时,小口喝水并侧卧有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到噁心時,小口喝水並側臥有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this is frequent for you, consider talking to a professional about alternatives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这对您很频繁,请考虑与专业人士讨论替代方案。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果這對您很頻繁,請考慮與專業人士討論替代方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If withdrawal symptoms concern you, seek medical advice. Help exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果担心戒断症状,请寻求医疗建议。帮助是存在的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果擔心戒斷症狀,請尋求醫療建議。幫助是存在的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel anxious, focus on slow breathing. It passes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦虑,专注于慢呼吸。它会过去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦慮,專注於慢呼吸。它會過去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel nauseous, lie on your side and sip ginger tea or plain water." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到恶心时,侧卧并小口喝姜茶或清水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到噁心時,側臥並小口喝薑茶或清水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel spacey, grounding exercises: name 5 things you can see, 4 you can touch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感觉飘忽,做接地练习:说出 5 件您能看见的、4 件能触摸的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感覺飄忽,做接地練習:說出 5 件您能看見的、4 件能觸摸的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel unwell, don't hesitate to call for help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如感到不适,请毫不犹豫地寻求帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如感到不適,請毫不猶豫地尋求幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you lose this passphrase, the backup can't be recovered. There is no reset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你丢失此口令，备份将无法恢复。无法重置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你遺失此通行碼，備份將無法還原。無法重設。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need help right now:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您现在需要帮助:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您現在需要幫助:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you've been using regularly, talk to a doctor about tapering — never stop abruptly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您一直规律使用,请咨询医生关于逐渐减量 — 切勿突然停药。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您一直規律使用,請諮詢醫生關於逐漸減量 — 切勿突然停藥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your jaw is sore, gentle massage and magnesium help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果下颌酸痛,轻柔按摩和镁有帮助。"
