    "Irreversible Cyclooxygenase (COX) Inhibitor" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆环氧合酶 (COX) 抑制剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆環氧合酶 (COX) 抑制劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Irreversible Monoamine Oxidase Inhibitor (MAOI)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆单胺氧化酶抑制剂 (MAOI)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆單胺氧化酶抑制劑 (MAOI)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Irreversibly inhibits cyclooxygenase enzymes by acetylating a serine residue in the active site. COX-1 inhibition in platelets prevents thromboxane A2 synthesis, irreversibly blocking platelet aggregation for the platelet's lifetime (7–10 days). COX-2 inhibition reduces prostaglandin synthesis, providing anti-inflammatory, analgesic, and antipyretic effects. The irreversible nature of inhibition is pharmacologically unique among NSAIDs." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过乙酰化活性位点的丝氨酸残基不可逆地抑制环氧合酶。血小板中的 COX-1 抑制阻止血栓素 A2 合成,在血小板的整个寿命期(7–10 天)内不可逆地阻断血小板聚集。COX-2 抑制减少前列腺素合成,提供抗炎、镇痛和退热效应。这种不可逆抑制的性质在非甾体抗炎药中独一无二。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過乙醯化活性位點的絲胺酸殘基不可逆地抑制環氧合酶。血小板中的 COX-1 抑制阻止血栓素 A2 合成,在血小板的整個壽命期(7–10 天)內不可逆地阻斷血小板聚集。COX-2 抑制減少前列腺素合成,提供抗炎、鎮痛和退熱效應。這種不可逆抑制的性質在非類固醇消炎藥中獨一無二。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Irreversibly inhibits monoamine oxidase enzymes (MAO-A and MAO-B), which are responsible for the oxidative deamination of monoamine neurotransmitters. MAO-A primarily metabolizes serotonin, norepinephrine, and dopamine; MAO-B primarily metabolizes phenylethylamine and dopamine. Inhibition increases synaptic levels of all monoamines. Requires dietary tyramine restriction due to risk of hypertensive crisis." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆地抑制单胺氧化酶 (MAO-A 和 MAO-B),后者负责单胺神经递质的氧化脱氨。MAO-A 主要代谢血清素、去甲肾上腺素和多巴胺;MAO-B 主要代谢苯乙胺和多巴胺。抑制会增加所有单胺的突触水平。由于有高血压危象的风险,需要饮食中限制酪胺。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆地抑制單胺氧化酶 (MAO-A 和 MAO-B),後者負責單胺神經傳導物質的氧化脫氨。MAO-A 主要代謝血清素、去甲腎上腺素和多巴胺;MAO-B 主要代謝苯乙胺和多巴胺。抑制會增加所有單胺的突觸水平。由於有高血壓危象的風險,需要飲食中限制酪胺。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Irreversibly inhibits the hydrogen-potassium ATPase (H⁺/K⁺ ATPase, the proton pump) on the luminal surface of gastric parietal cells. This blocks the final step of acid secretion regardless of the stimulus, producing a profound and long-lasting reduction in gastric acid production. Requires activation in the acidic environment of the parietal cell canaliculus." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆地抑制胃壁细胞管腔表面的氢-钾 ATP 酶(H⁺/K⁺ ATP 酶,质子泵)。这阻断了酸分泌的最后一步,无论刺激如何,产生深远而持久的胃酸生产减少。需要在壁细胞小管的酸性环境中激活。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可逆地抑制胃壁細胞管腔表面的氫-鉀 ATP 酶(H⁺/K⁺ ATP 酶,質子泵)。這阻斷了酸分泌的最後一步,無論刺激如何,產生深遠而持久的胃酸生產減少。需要在壁細胞小管的酸性環境中激活。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's been a long session. Your body and brain need sleep to recover. Try to wind down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已经持续了很长时间。您的身体和大脑需要睡眠来恢复。试着放松一下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已經持續了很長時間。您的身體和大腦需要睡眠來恢復。試著放鬆一下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
