            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分激動劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Partial agonist at dopamine D3 and D2 receptors with preferential affinity for D3 receptors. D3 receptor occupancy in the mesolimbic pathway may particularly benefit negative symptoms, cognitive deficits, and anhedonia. Also acts as a partial agonist at 5-HT1A and an antagonist at 5-HT2A/2B receptors. Has an active metabolite with a very long half-life." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对多巴胺 D3 和 D2 受体为部分激动剂,对 D3 受体有优先亲和力。中脑边缘通路中的 D3 受体占用可能特别有利于阴性症状、认知缺陷和快感缺失。也作为 5-HT1A 的部分激动剂和 5-HT2A/2B 受体的拮抗剂。具有半衰期非常长的活性代谢物。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "對多巴胺 D3 和 D2 受體為部分激動劑,對 D3 受體有優先親和力。中腦邊緣通路中的 D3 受體佔用可能特別有利於陰性症狀、認知缺陷和快感缺失。也作為 5-HT1A 的部分激動劑和 5-HT2A/2B 受體的拮抗劑。具有半衰期非常長的活性代謝物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Partial μ-Opioid Agonist and Adrenergic/Serotonergic Modulator" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分 μ-阿片激动剂兼肾上腺素能/血清素能调节剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分 μ-阿片激動劑兼腎上腺素能/血清素能調節劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
