    },
    "Reduced effects and risk of serotonin syndrome — SSRIs block MDMA's mechanism." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "效果减弱并有血清素综合征的风险 — SSRI 会阻断 MDMA 的作用机制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "效果減弱並有血清素綜合徵的風險 — SSRI 會阻斷 MDMA 的作用機制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduces central nervous system excitability, typically through enhancement of inhibitory GABAergic neurotransmission and/or reduction of excitatory glutamatergic neurotransmission. Produces sedation, anxiolysis, and muscle relaxation in a dose-dependent manner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "降低中枢神经系统兴奋性,通常通过增强抑制性 GABA 能神经传递和/或减少兴奋性谷氨酸能神经传递。以剂量依赖的方式产生镇静、抗焦虑和肌肉松弛。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "降低中樞神經系統興奮性,通常透過增強抑制性 GABA 能神經傳導和/或減少興奮性麩胺酸能神經傳導。以劑量依賴的方式產生鎮靜、抗焦慮和肌肉鬆弛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduces pain perception through mechanisms that may include inhibition of prostaglandin synthesis, activation of endogenous opioid pathways, modulation of descending pain inhibitory circuits, or blockade of peripheral nociceptor sensitization. The specific mechanism depends on the drug class." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过抑制前列腺素合成、激活内源性阿片通路、调节下行性痛觉抑制环路或阻断外周伤害感受器敏化等机制减少痛觉。具体机制取决于药物类别。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過抑制前列腺素合成、激活內源性阿片通路、調節下行性痛覺抑制環路或阻斷外周傷害感受器敏化等機制減少痛覺。具體機制取決於藥物類別。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
