    "Restoring reads an encrypted backup and adds its entries back. Passphrase backups will ask for the passphrase; iCloud backups unlock automatically on your own devices." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
