            "value" : "再攝取抑制劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reversible Inhibitor of Monoamine Oxidase A (RIMA)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆性单胺氧化酶 A 抑制剂 (RIMA)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆性單胺氧化酶 A 抑制劑 (RIMA)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reversibly inhibits cyclooxygenase enzymes COX-1 and COX-2, reducing the synthesis of prostaglandins from arachidonic acid. COX-2 inhibition mediates anti-inflammatory and analgesic effects, while COX-1 inhibition reduces gastric mucosal protection. Central prostaglandin inhibition contributes to antipyretic effects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆地抑制环氧合酶 COX-1 和 COX-2,减少花生四烯酸合成前列腺素。COX-2 抑制介导抗炎和镇痛效应,而 COX-1 抑制减少胃黏膜保护。中枢前列腺素抑制助长退热效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可逆地抑制環氧合酶 COX-1 和 COX-2,減少花生四烯酸合成前列腺素。COX-2 抑制介導抗炎和鎮痛效應,而 COX-1 抑制減少胃黏膜保護。中樞前列腺素抑制助長退熱效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Right now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Risk of fatal serotonin syndrome — do not combine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有致命血清素综合征的风险 — 切勿合用。"
