        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "登入 iCloud 並開啟 iCloud 雲碟以啟用自動加密備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Significant respiratory depression risk and profound loss of consciousness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显著的呼吸抑制风险和深度意识丧失。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "顯著的呼吸抑制風險和深度意識喪失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Similar to aripiprazole, acts as a partial agonist at dopamine D2 and serotonin 5-HT1A receptors, and an antagonist at 5-HT2A receptors. Compared to aripiprazole, has lower intrinsic activity at D2 receptors (more antagonist-like) and stronger 5-HT1A partial agonism, which may reduce akathisia and improve tolerability." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "类似于阿立哌唑,作为多巴胺 D2 和血清素 5-HT1A 受体的部分激动剂,以及 5-HT2A 受体的拮抗剂。与阿立哌唑相比,在 D2 受体上的内在活性较低(更像拮抗剂),5-HT1A 部分激动更强,这可能减少静坐不能并改善耐受性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "類似於阿立哌唑,作為多巴胺 D2 和血清素 5-HT1A 受體的部分激動劑,以及 5-HT2A 受體的拮抗劑。與阿立哌唑相比,在 D2 受體上的內在活性較低(更像拮抗劑),5-HT1A 部分激動更強,這可能減少靜坐不能並改善耐受性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sip some water — a glass every 30-60 minutes. Don't overdo it, just stay steady." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小口喝水 — 每 30 至 60 分钟一杯。不要过量，保持稳定即可。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小口喝水 — 每 30 至 60 分鐘一杯。不要過量，保持穩定即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sip water steadily, but don't overdo it. A glass every 30-60 minutes is fine." : {
