    "Some combinations increase serotonin or seizure risk — monitor for symptoms." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某些组合会增加血清素或癫痫的风险 — 注意监测症状。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某些組合會增加血清素或癲癇的風險 — 注意監測症狀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some dissociative afterglow is common — the world may feel slightly 'off' for a while." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一些解离性余韵很常见 — 世界可能在一段时间内感觉略有「不对」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一些解離性餘韻很常見 — 世界可能在一段時間內感覺略有「不對」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some emotional sensitivity and physical fatigue is completely normal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一些情绪敏感和身体疲劳完全正常。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一些情緒敏感和身體疲勞完全正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some residual visual or thought patterns can linger — this is normal and fades." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一些视觉或思维残余可能会持续 — 这是正常的,会消退。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一些視覺或思維殘餘可能會持續 — 這是正常的,會消退。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone who knows you can help more than you’d expect. You don’t have to explain everything — just hearing a familiar voice helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解您的人比您想象的更能提供帮助。您不必解释一切 — 只是听到熟悉的声音就有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解您的人比您想像的更能提供幫助。您不必解釋一切 — 只是聽到熟悉的聲音就有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sort" : {
