    "SSRI and 5-HT1A Partial Agonist" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 兼 5-HT1A 部分激动剂"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 兼 5-HT1A 部分激動劑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs inhibit TCA metabolism — risk of TCA toxicity and serotonin syndrome." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 抑制 TCA 代谢 — 有 TCA 中毒和血清素综合征的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 抑制 TCA 代謝 — 有 TCA 中毒和血清素綜合徵的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs typically reduce psychedelic effects but may increase risk with some compounds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 通常会减弱致幻效应,但与某些化合物可能增加风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI 通常會減弱致幻效應,但與某些化合物可能增加風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSRIs, SNRIs, and MAOIs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI、SNRI 与 MAOI。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSRI、SNRI 與 MAOI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stabilizes neuronal membranes by blocking voltage-gated sodium channels in their inactivated state, reducing sustained repetitive firing. Preferentially reduces glutamate release rather than GABA release, distinguishing it from other sodium channel blockers and potentially accounting for its mood-stabilizing properties, particularly in preventing depressive episodes in bipolar disorder." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过在失活态阻断电压门控钠通道稳定神经元膜,减少持续重复放电。优先减少谷氨酸释放而非 GABA 释放,这使其与其他钠通道阻滞剂有所不同,可能解释了其情绪稳定特性,特别是在预防双相情感障碍的抑郁发作方面。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過在失活態阻斷電壓門控鈉通道穩定神經元膜,減少持續重複放電。優先減少麩胺酸釋放而非 GABA 釋放,這使其與其他鈉通道阻滯劑有所不同,可能解釋了其情緒穩定特性,特別是在預防雙相情感障礙的鬱期方面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stable ~%@ days once reconstituted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复溶后约可稳定 %@ 天"
