    "Stay hydrated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持水分"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持水分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay hydrated — opioids are dehydrating and constipating." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持水分 — 阿片类会导致脱水和便秘。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持水分 — 阿片類會導致脫水和便秘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay hydrated and comfortable. Avoid redosing to chase the feeling — reach out if you need support." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持水分,让自己舒适。避免再次服用以追求感觉 — 如有需要请寻求支持。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持水分,讓自己舒適。避免再次服用以追求感覺 — 如有需要請尋求支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay seated or lying down. Your balance may not be what you think it is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持坐姿或躺下。您的平衡感可能不如您以为的好。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持坐姿或躺下。您的平衡感可能不如您以為的好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay somewhere calm and safe. The rebound anxiety is temporary." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留在平静、安全的地方。反弹性焦虑是暂时的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留在平靜、安全的地方。反彈性焦慮是暫時的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay somewhere comfortable and safe. Eat and hydrate when you can. Avoid driving." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留在舒适且安全的地方。能吃喝时就补充水分和食物。避免驾驶。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留在舒適且安全的地方。能吃喝時就補充水分和食物。避免駕駛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay somewhere safe with someone you trust if possible." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果可能,留在安全的地方,有您信任的人在身边。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果可能,留在安全的地方,有您信任的人在身邊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay somewhere safe. Don't drive. Your coordination and judgment are affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留在安全的地方。不要开车。您的协调能力和判断力受到影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留在安全的地方。不要開車。您的協調能力和判斷力受到影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay warm — your body's temperature regulation is still off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保暖 — 您的体温调节仍未恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保暖 — 您的體溫調節仍未恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stimulant" : {
      "localizations" : {
