            "value" : "強效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Strong encryption" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "强加密"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "強加密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Structurally related to amphetamine, acts on monoamine transporters as either a releasing agent, reuptake inhibitor, or both, depending on the specific compound. Generally increases synaptic dopamine, norepinephrine, and/or serotonin. The ratio of dopamine to serotonin activity varies significantly between compounds and determines whether effects are more stimulant-like or empathogenic." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结构上与苯丙胺相关,作用于单胺转运体,根据具体化合物可作为释放剂、再摄取抑制剂或两者兼有。通常增加突触多巴胺、去甲肾上腺素和/或血清素。多巴胺与血清素活性的比例在不同化合物之间差异很大,决定效应是更偏兴奋型还是共感型。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "結構上與苯丙胺相關,作用於單胺轉運體,根據具體化合物可作為釋放劑、再攝取抑制劑或兩者兼有。通常增加突觸多巴胺、去甲腎上腺素和/或血清素。多巴胺與血清素活性的比例在不同化合物之間差異很大,決定效應是更偏興奮型還是共感型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Structurally related to MDMA, acts as a monoamine releasing agent with strong serotonergic predominance. Releases serotonin, dopamine, and norepinephrine via transporter reversal. Compared to MDMA, has more pronounced psychedelic effects attributed to greater 5-HT2A receptor agonism from a metabolite, alongside empathogenic effects from serotonin release." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结构上与 MDMA 相关,作为以血清素能为主的单胺释放剂。通过转运体反转释放血清素、多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素。与 MDMA 相比,因代谢物对 5-HT2A 受体的激动更强,致幻效应更明显,同时血清素释放带来共感效应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "結構上與 MDMA 相關,作為以血清素能為主的單胺釋放劑。透過轉運體反轉釋放血清素、多巴胺和去甲腎上腺素。與 MDMA 相比,因代謝物對 5-HT2A 受體的激動更強,致幻效應更明顯,同時血清素釋放帶來共感效應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
