    },
    "Wellness Reminders" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康提醒"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wellness reminders send hydration and sleep nudges automatically. Phase notifications alert you at onset, come-up, and peak — requires a substance with duration data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康提醒会自动发送补水和睡眠提示。阶段通知会在起效、上升期和巅峰时提醒您 — 需要物质具备时长数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康提醒會自動發送補水和睡眠提示。階段通知會在起效、上升期和巔峰時提醒您 — 需要物質具備時長資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is this?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是什么？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是什麼？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to avoid" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应避免的事"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "應避免的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's happening" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在发生什么"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在發生什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whatever you're experiencing right now, help is available and you don't have to face it alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无论您此刻经历什么,都有可寻求的帮助,您不必独自面对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無論您此刻經歷什麼,都有可尋求的幫助,您不必獨自面對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a session reaches this many different substances, the timeline splits overlapping curves into separate stacked lanes — one per substance — so a busy session stays readable. When off, every curve is always overlaid on one graph." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当某次记录达到这么多种不同物质时，时间线会将重叠的曲线拆分为独立的堆叠泳道——每种物质一条——让繁忙的记录依然清晰可读。关闭后，所有曲线始终叠加在同一张图上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當某次記錄達到這麼多種不同物質時，時間線會將重疊的曲線拆分為獨立的堆疊泳道——每種物質一條——讓繁忙的記錄依然清晰可讀。關閉後，所有曲線始終疊加在同一張圖上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Piru encrypts your journal and saves it to your private iCloud Drive each time you leave the app. The encryption key is stored only in your iCloud Keychain, so the backup is end-to-end encrypted — **neither Apple nor Piru can read it**, and it restores automatically on your other devices signed in to the same Apple Account." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，每次你离开应用时，Piru 会加密你的记录并保存到你的私人 iCloud 云盘。加密密钥仅存储在你的 iCloud 钥匙串中，因此备份是端到端加密的——**Apple 和 Piru 都无法读取**，并且会在你登录同一 Apple 账户的其他设备上自动恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，每次你離開 App 時，Piru 會加密你的記錄並儲存到你的私人 iCloud 雲碟。加密金鑰僅儲存在你的 iCloud 鑰匙圈中，因此備份為端對端加密——**Apple 與 Piru 皆無法讀取**，並會在你登入同一 Apple 帳戶的其他裝置上自動還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Piru encrypts your journal and saves it to your private iCloud Drive each time you leave the app. The key is stored only in your iCloud Keychain, so it's end-to-end encrypted — **neither Apple nor Piru can read it** — and it restores on your other devices signed in to the same Apple Account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，每次你离开 App 时，Piru 都会加密你的日志并保存到你的私人 iCloud 云盘。密钥只存储在你的 iCloud 钥匙串中，因此是端到端加密——**Apple 和 Piru 都无法读取**——并且会在登录同一 Apple 账户的其他设备上自动恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，每次你離開 App 時，Piru 都會加密你的日誌並儲存到你的私人 iCloud 雲碟。金鑰只儲存在你的 iCloud 鑰匙圈中，因此是端對端加密——**Apple 和 Piru 都無法讀取**——並且會在登入同一 Apple 帳號的其他裝置上自動還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you wait or if you just need to calm down:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在等待时,或如果您只是想冷静下来:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在等待時,或如果您只是想冷靜下來:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write down anything meaningful before the details fade." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在细节消失前记下任何有意义的内容。"
