        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體重新校準時,您可能感到顫抖、焦慮或噁心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll get care reminders as the effects begin to fade — hydration, nutrition, and recovery tips." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "效果开始消退时,您会收到护理提醒 — 补水、营养和恢复提示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "效果開始消退時,您會收到護理提醒 — 補水、營養和恢復提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're coming back to baseline. Rest, eat something light. Give yourself time to process the experience." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您正在回到基线状态。休息、吃些清淡的东西。给自己时间来消化这次体验。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您正在回到基線狀態。休息、吃些清淡的東西。給自己時間來消化這次體驗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're going to be okay" : {
